{"version":1,"content":"<p>影視串流平台Netflix今天公布10月12日至18日一周收視成績，《Argo救參任務》賓艾費力（Ben Affleck）自編自導自演政治驚慄片《人性本獸》以3080萬觀看次數，蟬聯英語電影收視榜首，亦是上周最多人收看的影視節目；</p><p>佐斯夏利（Josh Hartnett）主演加拿大劇集《暗潮之下》亦不遑多讓，錄得2120萬觀看次數，再奪英語節目收視冠軍。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T11:40:34.782153+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":177,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T11:19:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T18:17:40.306851+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T11:37:40.197865+00:00","content_hash":"f773f4483edb5149c940df52bf6ef6c2adcfbd565803a7be9945262f103d61bc","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}